-- BeeAware Global roadmap -- Spain municipios (>20k population) geometry.
--
-- Real boundaries + names for the 427 Spanish municipalities the
-- Ministerio del Interior's own Portal Estadistico de Criminalidad
-- publishes crime data for below province level (population > ~20,000),
-- fetched from georiesgo.com's public static GeoJSON mirror
-- (https://georiesgo.com/data/municipios-detalle.json) -- see
-- EsCrimeAdapter's header for the full source/provenance story and why
-- this area_type is MUNICIPIO, not the Brazil-specific MUNICIPALITY.
-- Names are unique across all 427 features (verified) so the existing
-- name-match trigger links every event without ambiguity.
